rust-migration-notes.md
# reelkit text-layer intermediates — regenerated by every render, never shipped.
# Each re-render otherwise commits a fresh copy of all of them into history, and
# git keeps every version forever. Deliverables (-cover.jpg, -sheet.jpg,
# -timeline.json, the mp4s) do not match these patterns.
nixwoods-reel/*-reels/out/**/*-c[0-9][0-9].png
nixwoods-reel/*-reels/out/**/*-end.png
